        "thread_goal": "Coordinate removal of damaged surface, subgrade prep, and base course placement",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 6789,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Morning all. We've started T3, removing the damaged road surface. I'm updating the Progress Sheet A3 live. Let's target 100m of surface removal per day to stay on schedule.",
