          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 168084,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "100m a day sounds achievable. I've completed the pre-start checks on the excavator as per A2, all good.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 192754,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "I found a really soft bit of ground here after we took the asphalt off. What should be done?",
            "mentions": [
              70034
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 70034,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "Good catch. That's a subgrade failure. We need to dig it out until you hit firm material. Don't just fill over it. Measure the area and depth so we can track it in A3.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 384719,
            "reply_to": "M22",
            "text": "How deep should he go?",
            "mentions": [
              192754
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M24",
            "speaker_id": 70034,
            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "Until the ground is solid under the excavator bucket. It's a judgment call, but you'll feel the difference. Then we backfill with new base course material for T4.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M25",
            "speaker_id": 168084,
            "reply_to": "M24",
            "text": "If we find a lot of these, it could slow us down. Should we adjust the daily target?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M26",
            "speaker_id": 70034,
            "reply_to": "M25",
            "text": "Let's make a formal decision on this. For now, we'll stick to the target and just log the extra time for remediation. If it becomes a major issue, we'll revisit. So, Decision: We confirm the target daily production rate for T3 is 100m of surface removal, with remediation time logged separately in A3.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T3",
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D3"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M27",
            "speaker_id": 70034,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "And for the procedure: Decision: The standard treatment for any weak subgrade zones discovered during T3 will be to excavate to firm ground and replace with compacted base material as part of T4.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T3",
